1
00:00:22,799 --> 00:00:26,683
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,083 --> 00:00:33,698
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,571 --> 00:00:40,709
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,047 --> 00:00:47,056
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,267 --> 00:00:51,188
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:54,490
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,787 --> 00:00:59,022
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,007 --> 00:01:03,915
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,213 --> 00:01:07,099
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,409 --> 00:01:12,191
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,191 --> 00:01:16,771
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,771 --> 00:01:18,770
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,973 --> 00:01:24,755
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,139 --> 00:01:29,450
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,450 --> 00:01:31,958
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,204 --> 00:01:42,421
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,871 --> 00:01:48,705
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,705 --> 00:01:51,623
=Episode 20=

19
00:01:52,959 --> 00:01:56,760
Was it you
who killed my parents back then?

20
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,120
No.

21
00:02:08,719 --> 00:02:09,719
Back then,

22
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,360
they were trying to save me.

23
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,800
(I was born with two demon cores,)

24
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,000
(one good and one evil.)

25
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:18,360
(They shared one body,)

26
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,840
(unacceptable to the heavens.)

27
00:02:21,319 --> 00:02:22,560
(To attain the righteous path,)

28
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:24,800
(the two demon cores
had to be merged into one.)

29
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,599
(As I faced the thunder tribulation)

30
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:28,919
(and was about to fuse
the two demon cores,)

31
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:31,520
(an immensely powerful evil spirit)

32
00:02:31,919 --> 00:02:32,919
(tried to devour me)

33
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,840
(at my weakness.)

34
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,840
Finally found you,

35
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,280
Dual-Core White Snake,

36
00:02:40,759 --> 00:02:43,039
a tonic rare in a millennium.

37
00:02:43,759 --> 00:02:45,840
Today, I will claim your life

38
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,159
to empower my demonic arts

39
00:02:47,159 --> 00:02:50,479
and break the confinement
that held me for years!

40
00:02:54,879 --> 00:02:55,879
Vile demon!

41
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:57,520
How dare you devour cores for evil arts?

42
00:02:57,879 --> 00:02:59,319
This is a crime against heaven!

43
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:02,080
How dare you challenge me,
ignorant mortal?

44
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:03,840
Seal his meridians with the five grains!

45
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,039
Father! Mother!

46
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,080
Xu Xian, run!

47
00:03:25,159 --> 00:03:28,159
Y-You killed my parents!

48
00:03:32,479 --> 00:03:34,159
Heaven clear, earth murky.

49
00:03:34,159 --> 00:03:35,520
All evil, be gone!

50
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:51,680
Vile creature, stop at once.

51
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,759
Father? Father?

52
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:03,719
Father?

53
00:04:07,599 --> 00:04:11,080
Mother? Mother? Mother!

54
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,560
Mother, wake up!

55
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,920
Though I didn't do it,

56
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,000
they did die because of me.

57
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:45,720
I'm sorry.

58
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,040
How many years ago was that?

59
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:53,800
Ten years ago.

60
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:56,160
Ten years ago?

61
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,879
Ten years ago, a major incident
did happen at the temple.

62
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:13,439
Back then, Master departed
with fourteen of our martial uncles.

63
00:05:13,439 --> 00:05:14,439
But in the end,

64
00:05:14,439 --> 00:05:16,319
only Master and eight of them returned.

65
00:05:55,759 --> 00:05:57,120
What do you hate the most?

66
00:06:00,079 --> 00:06:01,079
Deception.

67
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:05,000
What if the deception
was well-intentioned?

68
00:06:06,639 --> 00:06:07,639
It's still deception.

69
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,439
What if there was no other choice?

70
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,079
You just don't get it.

71
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,720
Suzhen.

72
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,360
Qing,

73
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,480
you've suffered all this time.

74
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:39,839
No, I... I...

75
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,920
Qing, let's go.

76
00:06:45,639 --> 00:06:49,040
Suzhen, the death of Xu Xian's parents
wasn't your fault.

77
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,680
Even if their death wasn't my fault,

78
00:06:57,480 --> 00:07:00,160
it happened because of me after all.

79
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:03,879
In the future, when he sees me,

80
00:07:03,879 --> 00:07:05,920
he'll be reminded
of the tragedy ten years ago.

81
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,000
Over time,

82
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,439
he'll inevitably resent me

83
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,040
and hate me.

84
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:25,319
(Xu Xian,)

85
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:28,079
(this talisman looks like
a chick pecking at rice.)

86
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,480
Can't you put some effort into it?

87
00:07:30,839 --> 00:07:32,600
Stop imposing your standards on our son.

88
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,519
What? Think only you can draw well?

89
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:35,519
It's your way or nothing?

90
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,480
Every child has their own talent.

91
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:38,920
He's not a little boy.

92
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,639
He refused to go study with Master.

93
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,000
He slacks off all day

94
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,120
and draws talismans awfully.

95
00:07:43,399 --> 00:07:44,480
And you keep spoiling him.

96
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:46,439
I'm his mother.
What's wrong with spoiling him?

97
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:48,079
I think Xu Xian draws wonderfully.

98
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,079
Come on, let me see.

99
00:07:58,079 --> 00:07:59,120
It'll work just fine.

100
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,639
Like it would work!

101
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:11,399
Still sleeping at this hour? Get out!

102
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:13,319
- I only slept in a bit.
- Go do a horse stance.

103
00:08:13,319 --> 00:08:14,639
Keep it up and I'll tell Mother.

104
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,120
Don't make me beat you.

105
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,399
You little brat.

106
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,839
Lost to your father again?

107
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,040
Your father isn't here.

108
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,240
Put it down and rest a bit.

109
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:37,080
Mother, if Father sees me,
he'll hit me again.

110
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,360
Then I will massage your legs.

111
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,559
Take a rest, alright?

112
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:45,000
Mother, stop it.

113
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:46,799
I must train hard

114
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,039
and defeat Father sooner.

115
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,639
(Then I'll go cut you a chicken leg.)

116
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:02,600
Suzhen, you've underestimated
how much you mean to Xu Xian.

117
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:06,879
When your evil self
trapped you in the mural,

118
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:11,200
Xu Xian was the first
to notice something was wrong.

119
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:14,440
He also risked his life

120
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,960
to save you
with the Du'e Ancient Scroll.

121
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,480
The injuries on him

122
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,799
were from saving me?

123
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:39,559
Qing, let's go.

124
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,480
And the love trial?

125
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,600
Won't you pass it?

126
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:44,960
Not anymore.

127
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:49,159
Let's go and pack up now.

128
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:56,960
Qing.

129
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,440
Take this.

130
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,080
I really like

131
00:10:05,879 --> 00:10:06,879
this embroidered ball.

132
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:47,159
Xu Xian, I'm sorry.

133
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:49,200
Qing and I are leaving now.

134
00:11:00,759 --> 00:11:02,240
I don't expect your forgiveness,

135
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:06,360
but I hope you can let go
of your obsession with revenge.

136
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:08,200
Neither my evil self

137
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,279
nor that evil demon

138
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,559
is someone you can handle.

139
00:11:25,519 --> 00:11:27,480
Suzhen, are we really leaving like this?

140
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,200
Let's go.

141
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:34,919
Staying here

142
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,840
will only cause him more pain.

143
00:13:38,919 --> 00:13:40,039
Mistook me for someone?

144
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,440
The Diamond Sutra says,

145
00:13:45,919 --> 00:13:47,720
"The past mind cannot be grasped,

146
00:13:48,039 --> 00:13:50,039
the present mind cannot be grasped,

147
00:13:50,399 --> 00:13:53,519
and the future mind cannot be grasped."

148
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:58,679
What's past has faded away,

149
00:13:59,279 --> 00:14:02,240
and the future is nothing
but a castle in the air.

150
00:14:02,679 --> 00:14:05,120
Better seize the present

151
00:14:05,639 --> 00:14:09,240
and cherish the one before you.

152
00:14:11,159 --> 00:14:12,320
I've heard that one.

153
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,720
You think I can't handle you?

154
00:14:26,399 --> 00:14:29,399
The Buddha saw a spider in a temple

155
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:33,879
and asked what was most precious
in this world.

156
00:14:34,759 --> 00:14:37,159
Three times, the spider answered,

157
00:14:37,159 --> 00:14:39,759
"What cannot be gained,
and what has been lost."

158
00:14:39,759 --> 00:14:40,759
Later on...

159
00:14:40,759 --> 00:14:41,840
She was reborn as a mortal

160
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:42,840
named Zhu'er.

161
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:51,919
Ananda once said

162
00:14:52,879 --> 00:14:54,919
that he had fallen for a woman.

163
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:58,279
The Buddha asked
how deeply he loved her.

164
00:14:58,919 --> 00:15:00,360
Ananda replied...

165
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:01,759
"I would become a stone bridge,

166
00:15:01,759 --> 00:15:04,000
enduring 500 years of wind,
500 years of sun,

167
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,279
and 500 years of rain,

168
00:15:05,279 --> 00:15:07,200
just for her to walk across."

169
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:13,759
You're making it very awkward for me.

170
00:15:14,639 --> 00:15:17,440
You're making it awkward for me too.

171
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:18,960
Why not pretend you haven't heard it?

172
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:20,320
Can't you let me finish the story?

173
00:15:20,879 --> 00:15:21,879
No.

174
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:25,360
But if I can't finish, I'll lose face.

175
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:27,519
I only know
these three stories in total.

176
00:15:27,519 --> 00:15:28,879
And aren't I doing this for you?

177
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,240
You think it's for me?

178
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:32,480
You're leaving? Why again?

179
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,679
I'm always left here alone.

180
00:15:33,919 --> 00:15:35,159
Don't leave. Come back.

181
00:15:35,159 --> 00:15:36,200
Just hear me out.

182
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:43,919
I still got it.

183
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:47,440
Amitabha.

184
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:03,360
Suzhen, you've waited for so long.

185
00:16:03,639 --> 00:16:04,960
Why don't we head back?

186
00:16:12,399 --> 00:16:13,399
Let's go.

187
00:17:03,064 --> 00:17:07,223
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

188
00:17:09,690 --> 00:17:14,068
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

189
00:17:15,611 --> 00:17:21,436
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

190
00:17:22,205 --> 00:17:26,672
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

191
00:17:29,537 --> 00:17:33,978
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

192
00:17:36,174 --> 00:17:40,904
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

193
00:17:42,116 --> 00:17:48,229
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

194
00:17:48,892 --> 00:17:54,674
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

195
00:17:54,674 --> 00:18:00,937
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

196
00:18:01,247 --> 00:18:07,606
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

197
00:18:07,777 --> 00:18:15,144
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

198
00:18:15,429 --> 00:18:20,976
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

199
00:18:21,467 --> 00:18:27,677
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

200
00:18:27,987 --> 00:18:34,760
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

201
00:18:35,757 --> 00:18:41,410
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

202
00:18:42,244 --> 00:18:46,652
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

203
00:18:47,417 --> 00:18:50,005
♪Having ever loved♪
